From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:59:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: panel: ilitek,ili9881c: Add Innolux
 AFJ101-BA2131

The Innolux AFJ101-BA2131 is a 10.1" 800x1280 MIPI-DSI LCD panel driven
by an Ilitek ILI9881C controller. It is sold by Xunlong as the official
"Orange Pi 10.1 inch MIPI LCD" for the Orange Pi 5 family, where the
vendor device trees describe it with this compatible string.

Document the compatible.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/display/panel/ilitek,ili9881c.yaml       | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/ilitek,ili9881c.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/ilitek,ili9881c.yaml
index 42e35986f..30bcecbb3 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/ilitek,ili9881c.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/ilitek,ili9881c.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
           - bananapi,lhr050h41
           - bestar,bsd1218-a101kl68
           - feixin,k101-im2byl02
+          - innolux,afj101-ba2131
           - raspberrypi,dsi-5inch
           - raspberrypi,dsi-7inch
           - startek,kd050hdfia020
